	KeyError: 'noin' -- in the Detailed Ancestral Report, the
	Relationship View and elsewhere.  Look the key up with dict.get(), falling back to the uninflected
	("") format, so a mistranslated locale degrades to a readable date
	instead of aborting.  Fixes #14100.  Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>

