	EditFamily, and EditPlace.  Also fixes a formatting bug in the EditCitation "New Citation with
	caller context" branch, which incorrectly included the empty page
	string as the %(id)s substitution value.  Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>

