2026-05-12  John Ralls <jralls@ceridwen.us>

	* gramps/grampsapp.py, gramps/gui/aboutdialog.py,
	gramps/gui/logger/_errorreportassistant.py,
	gramps/plugins/db/bsddb/bsddb.py, gramps/plugins/gramplet/leak.py: 
	Attempt to load berkeleydb with bsddb3 as a fallback.  Reversing the priority in most files, and permitting berkeleydb in
	gramps/plugins/db/bsddb/bsddb.py.  bsddb3 has been deprecated since Python 3.6 and does not support
	Python 3.10 and later.  Gramps 6.1 requires Python 3.10 so when this commit is merged up the
	merge commit should remove the bsddb3 blocks.  Fixes #14218

